      "Sourcing fabric directly from an Indian mill rather than through an agent or trading house gives brands mill-direct pricing, direct access to the production team for development, faster problem resolution, and transparent supply chain documentation for certification purposes. What follows is the process broken into the five steps a first-time buyer should expect.",
